# Icon files needed:
# - icon16.png (16x16 pixels)
# - icon48.png (48x48 pixels)  
# - icon128.png (128x128 pixels)
#
# To generate icons:
# 1. Open generate-icons.html in a web browser
# 2. Click "Generate All Icons" button (or wait for auto-generation)
# 3. Click the download links to save each icon
# 4. Place the downloaded PNG files in this directory
#
# The source SVG is available as icon.svg